<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia forex reserves rise to $4.29 bln in Oct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia forex reserves rise to $4.29 bln in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>FOREIGN EXCHANGE RESERVES</p>
<p> (in millions of dollars)	  Oct	 Sep	 Oct 95</p>
<p> Total reserves		  4,292.1    4,179.2	3,345.3</p>
<p> Bank of Slovenia reserves   2,356.7    2,265.9	1,688.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Total reserves are those held by the banking sector as a whole.</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
